WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
A payment-test run joins four contracts.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:07.680
The task envelope defines scope,
versions, expiry and budget.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.360
The policy decision binds
identity and authority.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.880
The evaluation manifest links
the candidate to independent checks.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.240
The evidence record connects
the artifacts and review.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.920
Every boundary verifies the same
relevant identity and digest.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:25.760
Missing durable evidence,
stale authorization or a mismatch

00:00:25.806 --> 00:00:29.440
should hold promotion rather than be
repaired by an optimistic summary.
